fixture tech01_dash_slash
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 1 "Dash-slash: dash into attack, frame-perfect cancel"; s5 Dash "dash is cancelable into attack from frame 6"
room test/flat
frames 60
input
  0 R dash
  # Pressed early, on dash frame 3: the buffer fires it on frame 6, the first frame allowed.
  2 R attack
  3..10 R
  # The chain carries on (side 2 from side 1's frame 6).
  11 R attack
  12..16 R
  # The next dash, pressed during side 2: it waits for the ground cooldown (24 f), then cancels
  # side 2 at once (side 2's frame 4 is long past).
  17..19 R dash
  20..59 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1 dash_frame=1
  never 1..4 event.attack=1
  at 5 event.attack=1 action=side1 dash_frame=0 state=ground carry>0
  # The cancel hands over the dash's momentum: the 50% carry-over runs under the strike.
  at 5 vx=2560
  at 11 event.attack=1 action=side2
  never 12..23 event.dash=1
  at 24 event.dash=1 action=none state=dash
end
